        "created_at": "2013-07-26T05:43:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would say yes. If the card is not a target than the damage is not redirected, the action of dealing damage proceeds as normal only now the environment card is discarded instead of going into play or back on top of the deck.</p>",
